WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Sheprd runs your coding agents in native chats, beside your terminal.

2
00:00:05.748 --> 00:00:10.088
Start one with the agent button, right next to the new tab button.

3
00:00:10.413 --> 00:00:16.753
Switch agents any time: Claude, Codex, Gemini, or any other you have installed.

4
00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:22.622
Ask for what you need. The agent reads your code, makes the change and runs the tests.

5
00:00:22.631 --> 00:00:28.651
Every step is a card: what it read, the lines it changed, and what the tests said.

6
00:00:28.659 --> 00:00:32.439
And the answer arrives formatted, ready for you to review.
